# Test 2-tier FatTree that is supposed to match	the default auto-generated topology
Nodes 1024
Tiers 2
Podsize 1024

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 8
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 32
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Asymmetric_speed_Gbps 50
Asymmetric_mode all
Asymmetric_number_of_switches 8
Radix_Down 32
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1

